            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Madɔ mo,” sɛdeɛ Awurade seɛ nie.\n    “Nanso, mobisa sɛ, ‘Wodɔɔ yɛn ɛkwan bɛn so?’ ”\n    Na Awurade bua sɛ, “Esau nyɛ Yakob nua anaa? Nanso madɔ Yakob,",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc0915",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
