        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Ebia Edom bɛka sɛ, “Ɛwom sɛ wɔadwera yɛn deɛ, nanso yɛbɛsane asi mmubuiɛ no bio.”\n    Nanso, yei ne deɛ Asafo Awurade nso seɛ: “Wɔbɛsi nanso mɛbubu no. Wɔbɛfrɛ wɔn, Amumuyɛ Asase, nnipa a Awurade abufuo bɛtena wɔn so daa.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc0985",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Mode mo ankasa ani bɛhunu na moaka sɛ, ‘Awurade kɛseyɛ tra Israel ahyeɛ nyinaa so!’",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc09d2",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Ɔbabarima de obuo ma nʼagya, na ɔsomfoɔ de anidie ma ne wura. Sɛ meyɛ Agya a, anidie a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ma me no wɔ he? Sɛ meyɛ Owura a, obuo a ɛfata me no wɔ he?” Yei na Asafo Awurade bisa.\n    Mo asɔfoɔ, mo na mosɛe me din.\n    “Na mobisa sɛ, ‘Ɛkwan bɛn na yɛ nam so sɛee wo din?’",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc0a22",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Mode aduane a ɛho agu fi bɛgu mʼafɔrebukyia so.\n    “Afei mobisa sɛ ‘Ɛkwan bɛn so na yɛfa guu wo ho fi?’\n    “Sɛ mokaa sɛ, Awurade ɛpono ho yɛ aniwu enti.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc0a48",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Sɛ mode mmoa a wɔn ani abɔ bɔ afɔdeɛ a, ɛnyɛ mmusuo? Sɛ mode mmoa a wɔyare anaa wɔyɛ mpakye bɔ afɔdeɛ a, ɛnyɛ mmusuo? Ɛyɛ a, momfa akyɛdeɛ a ɛte saa no nkɔma mo amrado, na monhwɛ sɛ, nʼani bɛsɔ na wagye wo ato mu anaa?” Deɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc0a8d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Afei mo nsrɛ Onyankopɔn, na ɔnhunu yɛn mmɔbɔ. Sɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ sei firi mo nkyɛn a, ɔbɛgye mo ato mu anaa?” Asafo Awurade na ɔrebisa.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e58531092a820bc0b16",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Anka mepɛ sɛ mo mu baako kɔtoto asɔredan no apono mu, na obi ankɔsɔ ogya a ɛmfata wɔ mʼafɔrebukyia so! Mʼani nsɔ mo, na merennye afɔrebɔdeɛ biara a ɛfiri mo nkyɛn,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0b4c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Ɛfiri deɛ owia pue kɔsi deɛ owia kɔtɔ, me din bɛyɛ kɛseɛ wɔ amanaman no mu. Baabiara, wɔde afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛho teɛ ne nnuhwam bɛbrɛ me, ɛfiri sɛ, me din bɛyɛ kɛseɛ wɔ amanaman no mu,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0bad",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Nanso mode kasa fi ka sɛ Awurade ɛpono ho nte. Na mobu ɛso aduane nso animtia.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0c06",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Na moka sɛ adesoa bɛn nie, na moyi mo ani firi mʼasɛm so,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.\n    “Sɛ mode mmoa a wɔapirapira, a wɔyɛ mpakye anaa wɔyareyare bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ma me a, me nsɔ mu anaa?” Yei na Awurade bisa.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0c29",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2c9a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Nnome nka osisifoɔ a ɔwɔ odwennini a ɔfata wɔ ne nnwankuo mu, na ɔhyɛ bɔ sɛ ɔde no bɛma nanso ɔde deɛ wadi dɛm na ɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ma Awurade. Meyɛ ɔhempɔn, na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsuro me din wɔ amanaman mu,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0d01",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Afei mo asɔfoɔ, saa animka yi wɔ mo.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0d1e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Sɛ moantie, sɛ moannyɛ mo adwene sɛ mobɛhyɛ me animuonyam a, mede nnome bɛba mo so, na mɛdane mo nhyira ama ayɛ nnome. Aane, madome mo dada, ɛfiri sɛ monyɛɛ mo adwene sɛ mobɛhyɛ me animuonyam, sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0d7d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Mo enti mɛka mo asefoɔ anim, na mede mo afahyɛ afɔrebɔ mmoa no agyanan bɛpete mo anim, na wɔasoa mo aka ho akɔ.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0d97",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Na mobɛhunu sɛ, masoma ma wɔde saa animka yi abrɛ mo sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a me ne Lewi apam no bɛkɔ so atena hɔ. Sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0dc5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Me ne no yɛɛ apam, nkwa ne asomdwoeɛ apam. Na apam no botaeɛ ne sɛ ɛbɛma Lewi nkwa ne asomdwoeɛ, enti memaa no nkwa ne asomdwoeɛ.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e59531092a820bc0e09",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Nokorɛ nkyerɛkyerɛ firii nʼanom, na wanka nkontomposɛm biara. Ɔne me nantee asomdwoeɛ ne nokorɛdie mu, na ɔmaa bebree danee wɔn ho firii bɔne ho.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc0e37",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
