        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Nanso moamane afiri ɛkwan no so, na mo nkyerɛkyerɛ ama bebree asuntisunti; moabu me ne Lewi apam no so.” Sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc0f2b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Enti, mama mo anim agu ase na mabrɛ mo ase wɔ nnipa anim, ɛfiri sɛ moannante mʼakwan so na mmom mode animhwɛ abu mmara so.”",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc0fb6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Yɛn nyinaa mfiri Agya baako anaa? Ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn baako na ɔbɔɔ yɛn? Na, afei, adɛn enti na yɛnni yɛn ho yɛn ho nokorɛ, na yɛde bu yɛn agyanom apam no so?",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc1050",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Yuda anni nokorɛ. Akyiwadeɛ bi asi wɔ Israel ne Yerusalem mu: Yuda agu hyiadan a Awurade dɔ no ho fi, ɛfiri sɛ waware ɔbaa a ɔsom ananafoɔ nyame.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc10a3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Ɔbarima a ɔyɛ yei deɛ, sɛdeɛ ɔteɛ biara, Awurade mpam no mfiri Yakob ntomadan mu, mpo sɛ ɔde afɔrebɔdeɛ rebrɛ Asafo Awurade no koraa a.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc111e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Adeɛ a moyɛ bio ne sɛ: mode nisuo fɔ Awurade afɔrebukyia no. Mote nisuo na motwa adwo ɛfiri sɛ ɔnhwɛ mo afɔrebɔdeɛ no bio, na ɔmmfa anigyeɛ nnye mfiri mo nkyɛn.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc1150",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Mobisa sɛ, “Adɛn nti?” Ɛfiri sɛ Awurade te sɛ ɔdanseni a ɔda wo ne wo mmeranteberɛ mu yere ntam, a woanni no nokorɛ.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc11c4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Ɛnyɛ Awurade korɔ no ara na ɔbɔɔ mo? Ɔhonam fam ne honhom fam no, moyɛ ne dea. Deɛn na Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ? Ɔrehwehwɛ mma a onyamesuro wɔ wɔn mu. Enti da wo ho so wɔ honhom mu, na di wo mmeranteberɛ mu yere nokorɛ.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc121a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Mekyiri awaregyaeɛ!” Sɛdeɛ Awurade Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ nie. “Na metane ɔbarima a ɔde abufuhyeɛ hyɛ ne yere so na ɔsane de ne ntoma kata ne so,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.\n    Enti da wo ho so wɔ honhom mu, na di nokorɛ.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5a531092a820bc127f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2cc9",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Mode mo nsɛm tuatua Awurade aso.\n    Mobisa sɛ, “Ɛkwan bɛn so na moatuatua nʼaso?”\n    Moka sɛ, “Wɔn a wɔyɛ bɔne nyinaa tene wɔ Awurade anim, na wɔsɔ nʼani,” anaa “Onyankopɔn ɔtemmufoɔ nokwafoɔ no wɔ he?”",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc13b2",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Hwɛ! Mɛsoma me ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔbɛsiesie ɛkwan ama me. Na afei, mpofirim, Awurade a morehwehwɛ no no bɛba nʼasɔredan mu. Na apam no ho ɔbɔfoɔ a mopɛ no no bɛba, sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc1404",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Na hwan na ɔbɛtumi agyina ne da a ɔbɛba no ano? Sɛ opue a, hwan na ɔbɛtumi agyina? Ɔbɛyɛ sɛ ogya dɛreɛ a wɔde nane dadeɛ anaa ntoma sifoɔ samina.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc141b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Ɔbɛtena ase sɛ obi a ɔhoa dwetɛ ho. Ɔbɛte Lewifoɔ no ho na wɔayɛ sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ ne dwetɛ. Afei Awurade bɛnya mmarimma a wɔde ayɛyɛdeɛ bɛba wɔ kronkronyɛ mu,",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc143a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "na afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛfiri Yuda ne Yerusalem bɛyɛ deɛ ɛsɔ Awurade ani sɛdeɛ na ɛteɛ wɔ mfeɛ a atwam no.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc1499",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Enti mɛtwe abɛn mo, abɛbu atɛn. Mɛyɛ ntɛm adi adanseɛ atia ntafowayifoɔ, awaresɛefoɔ ne atorofoɔ, wɔn a wɔsisi adwumayɛfoɔ wɔ wɔn akatua ho, wɔn a wɔhyɛ akunafoɔ ne nwisiaa so na wɔbu ntɛnkyea tia ahɔhoɔ na wɔnnsuro me,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc14f1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Meyɛ Awurade a mennsakyera. Ɛno enti na mo Yakob asefoɔ, wɔnsɛee mo no.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc1520",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Ɛfiri mo nananom ɛberɛ so, moatwe mo ho afiri me mmara ho. Moanni so. Monsane mmra me nkyɛn, na me nso mɛba mo nkyɛn,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.\n    “Nanso mobisa sɛ, ‘Ɛkwan bɛn so na yɛmfa nsane mmra?’",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc1563",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Onipa bɛtumi abɔ Onyankopɔn korɔno anaa? Nanso, mobɔ me korɔno! Na mobɛbisa sɛ, ‘ɛkwan bɛn so na yɛfa bɔɔ wo korɔno?’\n    “Wɔ ntotosoɔ dudu ne afɔrebɔdeɛ mu.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5b531092a820bc159b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Nnome aba mo so, ɔman mu no nyinaa, ɛfiri sɛ, morebɔ me korɔno.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5c531092a820bc15e5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Momfa ntotosoɔ dudu no nyinaa mmra adekoradan no mu, na aduane mmra me fie. Monsɔ me nhwɛ saa ɛkwan yi so, na monhwɛ sɛ meremmue ɔsoro mpomma na merenhwie nhyira bebree ngu mo so a morennya baabi nkora ne nyinaa mpo.” Sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5c531092a820bc163c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Meremma mmoa mmɛsɛe mo mfudeɛ na borɔdɔma aba rente ngu wɔ ɛberɛ a ɛmmereɛ,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5c531092a820bc1668",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Na aman no nyinaa bɛka sɛ wɔahyira mo, ɛfiri sɛ, mo asase so bɛyɛ anika,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e5c531092a820bc16a4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc67999137613db2d0b",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
