        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Afei, wɔfrɛ ɔhantanni no deɛ wɔahyira no. Nokorɛm, nnebɔneyɛfoɔ di yie, na mpo wɔn a wɔne Onyankopɔn di asie no, wɔfa wɔn ho di.’ ”",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
