        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Ɛnna wɔn a wɔsuro Awurade no ne wɔn ho wɔn ho kasaeɛ, na Awurade tieeɛ na ɔgyee wɔn so. Wɔn a wɔsuro Awurade na wɔdi ne din ni no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn din wɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ so wɔ nʼanim de yɛɛ nkaeɛ adeɛ.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
