            "book": "626b6bc67999137613db2c41"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Wɔbɛyɛ me dea,” sɛdeɛ, Asafo Awurade seɛ nie. Ɛda a mɛkeka me ho no, wɔbɛyɛ mʼahodeɛ a ɛsom bo. Mede wɔn ho bɛkyɛ wɔn, sɛdeɛ agya nya ayamhyehyeɛ de ɔba a ɔyɛ ɔsetie ho kyɛ no no.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
