        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "“Ampa ara, ɛda no reba; ɛbɛdɛre te sɛ fononoo. Ahomasofoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nyinaa bɛyɛ wiradwaneɛ, na saa da a ɛreba no, wɔde ogya bɛto mu,” sɛdeɛ Asafo Awurade seɛ nie. “Ɛrenka nhini anaa dubaa ɛmma wɔn.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
