        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "Nanso, mo a mode anidie ma me din no, tenenee awia bɛpue ama mo, na ɛde ayaresa bɛba. Na mobɛpue na moahurihuri te sɛ anantwie mma a wɔabue wɔn afiri wɔn buo mu.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
