        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "“Monkae mʼakoa Mose mmara ne ahyɛdeɛ a mede maa no wɔ Horeb so sɛ ɔmfa mma Israelfoɔ nyinaa.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:4",
